# N4-box: jumps and grenades at e1m1's start, in the Classic box with no frame cap. The
# player at (480,-352,88, yaw 90), its own eye, god mode, with the grenade launcher
# (`impulse 9`, `impulse 6`): it jumps (file seconds 2.0, 5.5, 10.0, 14.0) and fires
# grenades down the corridor (3.0, 7.0, 12.0). 960x600 shown 4:3, settings 1 to 4 on, and
# no frame cap: `clock free`, `stepping uncapped`, a host frame every 60 fps film frame.
# id's status bar, the gun, Brightness 0.8, id's mixer at 11025 Hz. 17.3 s with a second
# of handle each end.
#
# Under V3-31, "Run id's code faster, and the physics drifts: at four hundred and eighty
# hertz, jumps peak higher, and grenades land further.", and V3-32a, "The slop preset
# draws a frame on every refresh, and steps gravity so that every jump lands on id's
# seventy-two hertz curve."
#
# Assembly (LAB4c): the edit's jump diagram covers the box's right side, from just right
# of its centre.

map e1m1

duration 19.3
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
clock free
stepping uncapped
cvar r_torchflicker 1
cvar r_lerplightstyles 1
cvar r_lerpmove 1
cvar r_lerpmodels 1
cvar vid_native 0
cvar fov_adapt 0
cvar gamma 0.8
hud on
gun on

player 480,-352,88,90
camera player

impulse 9 at 0
impulse 6 at 0.1
cmd +jump at 2.0
cmd -jump at 2.3
attack on at 3.0
attack off at 3.4
cmd +jump at 5.5
cmd -jump at 5.8
attack on at 7.0
attack off at 7.4
cmd +jump at 10.0
cmd -jump at 10.3
attack on at 12.0
attack off at 12.4
cmd +jump at 14.0
cmd -jump at 14.3

sound on
events on
